{{wikipedia|Extraversion and introversion}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*wert-}}
From New {{der|en|la|introvertere|intrōvertere}}, from {{m|la|intro-||[[within]]}} and {{m|la|vertere||to [[turn]]}}. Popularized as a psychological term by the {{der|en|de|-}} works of {{w|Carl Jung}}.

